ckBauru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpockBauru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T17:53:37Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T17:53:37Z","body":"> @syntaxerror247 @SpockBauru does the fix still work if the editor is restarted?\r\n\r\nYes. This time tested on an copy of my personal project: opened with the Windows artifact, exported with Android template, closed and repeat. It still works.\r\n\r\nAfter that tested with and without Shader Baker. The difference is 5MB, less than I expected given how it was portrait in the blog post. Unfortunately I didn't noticed substantial loading times decrease for first time loading, even uninstalling and installing the app. \r\n\r\nAlso noted that async loading as a whole seems slower, but I don't know the cause and is likely not related to this issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2977515997/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2982031885","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107600#issuecomment-2982031885","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107600","id":2982031885,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xvjIN","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T22:40:53Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T22:40:53Z","body":"> Unfortunately I didn't noticed substantial loading times decrease for first time loading, even uninstalling and installing the app.\r\n\r\nShaders are currently compiled on the fly with glslang without any sort of optimizations and passed pretty much directly on Vulkan, so it's the backend with the least amount of speedup (although it can be measured). But this enables us to do some extra interesting future work like finally applying the shader optimizer when using shader baker instead. It might not lead to frametime improvements, but it should help the driver compile the pipelines faster as well as reduce the size of our shaders a bit.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2982031885/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"ur